{"strongs": "H0403", "word": "אָכֵן", "translit": "a.khen", "root": "אכן", "morph": "H:Adv", "pos": "adverb", "gloss": "surely, truly", "definition": "אָכֵן (perhaps from אַח ; compare Aramaic דֵּח & דִּכֵּן ) adverb with strong asseverative force: \\ \\ a. surely, truly , especially at beginning of a speech (stronger & more decided than אַח ) Gen 28:16 ; Exod 2:14 ; 1Sam 15:32 ; Isa 40:7 ; Isa 45:15 ; Jer 3:23 (twice in verse); Jer 4:10 ; Jer 8:8 . In 1Kgs 11:2 אָבֵן stands unusually; and פֶּןֿ (compare ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ7 ) should probably be read (so Klo ). \\ \\ b. emphasizing a contrast, but indeed, but in fact , especially after אָמַרְתִּי I said or thought , expressing the reality, in opposed to what had been wrongly imagined, Isa 49:4 b (opposed to v a ) Isa 53:4 (opposed to v Isa 53:3 end) Jer 3:20 (opposed to the expectation v Jer 3:19 b) Zeph 3:7 b Ps 31:23 b (opposed to v Ps 31:23 a) Ps 66:19 ; Ps 82:7 (opposed to v Ps 82:6 ) Job 32:8 (opposed to v Job 32:7 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB407')\">BDB407</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H403')\">H403</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB406')\">BDB406</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB408')\">BDB408</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אָכֵן</bdbheb> (perhaps from <bdbheb>אַח</bdbheb>; compare Aramaic <bdbarc>דֵּח</bdbarc> &amp; <bdbheb>דִּכֵּן</bdbheb>) <b>adverb</b> with strong asseverative force: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlightword>surely, truly</highlightword>, especially at beginning of a speech (stronger &amp; more decided than <bdbheb>אַח</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Gen 28:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,16)\">Gen 28:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 2:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,14)\">Exod 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:32\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,32)\">1Sam 15:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 40:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,7)\">Isa 40:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,15)\">Isa 45:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 3:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,23)\">Jer 3:23</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 4:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,10)\">Jer 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,8)\">Jer 8:8</ref>. In <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,2)\">1Kgs 11:2</ref> <bdbheb>אָבֵן</bdbheb> stands unusually; and <bdbheb>פֶּןֿ</bdbheb> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) should probably be read (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> emphasizing a contrast, <highlight>but indeed, but in fact</highlight>, especially after <bdbheb>אָמַרְתִּי</bdbheb> <highlight>I said</highlight> or <highlight>thought</highlight>, expressing the reality, in opposed to what had been wrongly imagined, <ref ref=\"Isa 49:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,4)\">Isa 49:4</ref>b (opposed to v<sup>a</sup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 53:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,4)\">Isa 53:4</ref> (opposed to v<ref ref=\"Isa 53:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,3)\">Isa 53:3</ref> end) <ref ref=\"Jer 3:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,20)\">Jer 3:20</ref> (opposed to the expectation v<ref ref=\"Jer 3:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,19)\">Jer 3:19</ref> b) <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:7\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,7)\">Zeph 3:7</ref>b <ref ref=\"Ps 31:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,23)\">Ps 31:23</ref>b (opposed to v<ref ref=\"Ps 31:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,23)\">Ps 31:23</ref>a) <ref ref=\"Ps 66:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,19)\">Ps 66:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 82:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"82\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"82\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,82,7)\">Ps 82:7</ref> (opposed to v<ref ref=\"Ps 82:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"82\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"82\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,82,6)\">Ps 82:6</ref>) <ref ref=\"Job 32:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,8)\">Job 32:8</ref> (opposed to v<ref ref=\"Job 32:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,7)\">Job 32:7</ref>). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 28:16", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 28, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Exod 2:14", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "1Sam 15:32", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Isa 40:7", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 45:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Jer 3:23", "book": "JER", "chapter": 3, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Jer 4:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 4, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Jer 8:8", "book": "JER", "chapter": 8, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Kgs 11:2", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 11, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 49:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 49, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Isa 53:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 53, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Isa 53:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 53, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 3:20", "book": "JER", "chapter": 3, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Jer 3:19", "book": "JER", "cha